  m_text: '(Press ''Q'' to Open/Close this Guide)

    1. Press ''I'' for Inventory

    2.
    Press ''P'' for Equipment

    3. Interact ''E'' with flag to start game

    4.
    Equip Gears from Chest

    5. Press ''F'' for Light Attack

    6. Press ''R''
    for Heavy Attack'
